.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-ACQUIRE 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-acquire \- Measure the bounded scope of a direct\-main graph acquisition
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu acquire\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Measure the bounded scope of a direct\-main graph acquisition
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-acquire\-scope(1)
Report the bounded row and byte scope of a direct\-main acquisition
.TP
quipu\-acquire\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
